# The shape of tests/real/allow-list.local, which the owner writes (it is git-ignored, and
# the harness never writes it). A run refuses any subscription, tenant or account not
# listed here. Copy this file to allow-list.local and put real values in; these are
# documentation placeholders.
#
# key                 value
azure-subscription    00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
azure-tenant          00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
azure-location        westus3
aws-account           000000000000
aws-region            us-west-2
aws-profile           omnifile-test
m365-tenant           00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
m365-test-user        test.user@example.com
# The address the owner's workstation reaches the test VM from (SSH, one /32 is best).
ssh-from              192.0.2.10/32
# The longest expiry a run may tag its resources with.
max-ttl-hours         24
